codex
The late failure was a performance regression, not a safety mismatch: I was re-canonicalizing the full home path at every fsync boundary, which held the home lock beyond the test’s 3-second contention budget. The witness is now canonicalized once on scope entry and compared immutably thereafter; the concurrency regression passes again in 2.44 seconds.
